language ESSENCE' 1.0
$ Select a set of workers so that every task is performed by at least one selected worker who is qualified for it, minimising the total hiring cost of the selected workers.
given nb_workers : int(1..)
given Cost : matrix indexed by [int(1..nb_workers)] of int(0..)
$ Qualified[t,p] is the p-th worker (1-based) qualified for task t; rows are padded with 0 beyond their length
given Qualified_dim1, Qualified_dim2 : int(1..)
given Qualified : matrix indexed by [int(1..Qualified_dim1), int(1..Qualified_dim2)] of int(0..)
find total_cost : int(0..sum(Cost))
find workers : matrix indexed by [int(1..nb_workers)] of bool

minimising total_cost
such that
$ the total cost is the sum of the hiring costs of the selected workers
total_cost = (sum w : int(1..nb_workers) . toInt(workers[w]) * Cost[w]),
$ every task is performed by at least one selected worker who is qualified for it
forAll t : int(1..Qualified_dim1) . (exists p : int(1..Qualified_dim2) . (Qualified[t,p] != 0) /\ workers[Qualified[t,p]])
